{"steam_appid":2106670,"steam_name":"Gatekeeper","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2106670/444433618/b38dd098c48a6006cac422bf27ef496931bf5ca2/1750746779/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748625168","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148346/6cb2f1e9245255279046b0af256c8cab36de3a9e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748625168","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/fc613cc89941c8ab9bd94dad9c82ea4fbb63234c/ss_fc613cc89941c8ab9bd94dad9c82ea4fbb63234c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777969946","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/690f903ad5ae0d3edcd2a4f0d4c4edf95be1003d/ss_690f903ad5ae0d3edcd2a4f0d4c4edf95be1003d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777969946","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/ss_9dbe9ea5b4f48df76e141543137772532d750e4c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777969946","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/ss_a3e1b171f2e247bd9266665d317317f9a13cd588.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777969946","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/b83144332f8911daf35e448c91591b0fcd41ae67/ss_b83144332f8911daf35e448c91591b0fcd41ae67.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777969946"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Heart of Time has been stolen by Chaos’s most powerful minions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must follow its trail, reach the Throne Room, and face Chaos in battle. But the path won’t be easy: before the final showdown, you’ll have to defeat Chaos’s elite Sirens and the endless legions under their command. Experience sharp, unexpected thrills in this action rogue-lite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/81c34e1231685cd664a4b3b1a809a2bc.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/81c34e1231685cd664a4b3b1a809a2bc.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/81c34e1231685cd664a4b3b1a809a2bc.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Gatekeeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 playable characters, each with unique skills to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/273cd432e82febb76874cc06af1f37f5.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/273cd432e82febb76874cc06af1f37f5.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/273cd432e82febb76874cc06af1f37f5.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Up with Friends</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to join you on this epic power-fantasy adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/0406fc7028cd98b258bd4c9d37a8553d.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/0406fc7028cd98b258bd4c9d37a8553d.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/0406fc7028cd98b258bd4c9d37a8553d.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain experience to fully unlock each Gatekeeper’s potential and combine their abilities with powerful artifact effects. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/7e5a55a9ab4b1b74d4443a642ea68026.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/7e5a55a9ab4b1b74d4443a642ea68026.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/7e5a55a9ab4b1b74d4443a642ea68026.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find and Collect 100+ Power-Ups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over a hundred unique artifacts with game-changing effects. Combine them into Triads and endlessly grow your combat power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/93dea7b6b2c2c15e88bdf4674a1decb7.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/93dea7b6b2c2c15e88bdf4674a1decb7.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/93dea7b6b2c2c15e88bdf4674a1decb7.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Objectives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each location features one of four mission types — complete it to summon a Siren for an epic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/0810cfc2a6f89dcc00cf1cc8d6c47dcc.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/0810cfc2a6f89dcc00cf1cc8d6c47dcc.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/0810cfc2a6f89dcc00cf1cc8d6c47dcc.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Biomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 distinct planets, each packed with diverse enemies and powerful bosses to defeat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/48db5f5e30f7c22809653a122d5e85ed.poster.avif?t=1777969946\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/48db5f5e30f7c22809653a122d5e85ed.webm?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106670/extras/48db5f5e30f7c22809653a122d5e85ed.mp4?t=1777969946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Gravity Lagoon"],"publishers":["HypeTrain Digital"],"release_date":"1 Aug, 2025"}